{"title": "Bladesong Climax", "pageid": 48954, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Bladesong_Climax", "categories": ["Class actions", "Intelligence saving throws", "Bonus actions", "Movement-expending actions", "Sources of Force damage", "Patch 8 content"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bladesong_Climax.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Bladesong_Climax.webp/300px-Bladesong_Climax.webp, /w/images/5/5e/Bladesong_Climax.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Bladesong_Climax.webp/300px-Bladesong_Climax.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5e/Bladesong_Climax.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Bladesong Climax</b> is the finale of a <a href=\"/wiki/Bladesinging\" title=\"Bladesinging\">Bladesinging</a> wizard's <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bladesong\" title=\"Bladesong\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Bladesong_Icon.webp/20px-Bladesong_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Bladesong_Icon.webp/30px-Bladesong_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Bladesong_Icon.webp/40px-Bladesong_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bladesong\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Bladesong_Icon.webp/20px-Bladesong_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/80/Bladesong_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bladesong\" title=\"Bladesong\">Bladesong</a>. The Bladesinger leaps to a target position and unleashes the charges accumulated over the course of the Bladesong to heal allies and damage enemies.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Unleash the full damaging and healing effects of your Bladesong at once. Your <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bladesong_Damage_Charge_(Condition)\" title=\"Bladesong Damage Charge (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Bladesong_Damage_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Bladesong_Damage_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Bladesong_Damage_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bladesong_Damage_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Bladesong_Damage_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Bladesong_Damage_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bladesong Damage Charges\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Bladesong_Damage_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Bladesong_Damage_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Bladesong_Damage_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bladesong_Damage_Charge_(Condition)\" title=\"Bladesong Damage Charge (Condition)\">Bladesong Damage Charges</a> will harm enemies an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span></a> damage, and your <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bladesong_Healing_Charge_(Condition)\" title=\"Bladesong Healing Charge (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bladesong_Healing_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Bladesong_Healing_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bladesong_Healing_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bladesong_Healing_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bladesong_Healing_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Bladesong_Healing_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bladesong Healing Charges\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bladesong_Healing_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Bladesong_Healing_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bladesong_Healing_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bladesong_Healing_Charge_(Condition)\" title=\"Bladesong Healing Charge (Condition)\">Bladesong Healing Charges</a> will heal you and your allies an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a>. \n</p>\nThis will end your <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bladesinging_(Condition)\" title=\"Bladesinging (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bladesinging_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Bladesinging_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bladesinging_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bladesinging_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bladesinging_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Bladesinging_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bladesong\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bladesinging_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Bladesinging_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bladesinging_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bladesinging_(Condition)\" title=\"Bladesinging (Condition)\">Bladesong</a>.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/42px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a> + <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> 3 m (10 ft) <a href=\"/wiki/Resources#Movement_speed\" title=\"Resources\">Movement Speed</a></dd><dt>Damage: 2~12</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:42px;height:30px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:9px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:1;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/D6_Force.png/27px-D6_Force.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/D6_Force.png/40px-D6_Force.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/D6_Force.png/54px-D6_Force.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/D6_Force.png/27px-D6_Force.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/D6_Force.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><span style=\"z-index:0;position:absolute;transform:translate( 40%, -30%) rotate(20deg)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/D6_Force.png/27px-D6_Force.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/D6_Force.png/40px-D6_Force.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/D6_Force.png/54px-D6_Force.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/D6_Force.png/27px-D6_Force.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/D6_Force.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">1d6</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span></a></div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"> + <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">1d6</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span></a> (Per Bladesong Damage Charge)</div></div></div></dd><dt>Healing: 2~12</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:42px;height:30px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:9px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:1;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/D6_Healing.png/27px-D6_Healing.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/74/D6_Healing.png/40px-D6_Healing.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/74/D6_Healing.png/54px-D6_Healing.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/D6_Healing.png/27px-D6_Healing.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/D6_Healing.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><span style=\"z-index:0;position:absolute;transform:translate( 40%, -30%) rotate(20deg)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/D6_Healing.png/27px-D6_Healing.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/74/D6_Healing.png/40px-D6_Healing.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/74/D6_Healing.png/54px-D6_Healing.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/D6_Healing.png/27px-D6_Healing.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/D6_Healing.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">1d6</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Healing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Healing</span></a></div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"> + <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">1d6</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Healing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Healing</span></a> (Per Bladesong Healing Charge)</div></div></div></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"INT Save (Spell save DC)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">INT</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Spell_save_DC\" title=\"Dice rolls\">Spell save DC</a>) (On Save: Enemies still take half damage.)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 9 m (30 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 9 m (30 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"AoE: 3 m (10 ft) Radius\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> AoE: 3 m (10 ft) Radius</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Projectile_Bladesong_Finisher</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Projectile_Bladesong_Finisher\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Projectile_Bladesong_Finisher\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=CannotTargetCharacter_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CannotTargetCharacter (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">CannotTargetCharacter</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=CannotTargetItems_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CannotTargetItems (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">CannotTargetItems</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasHighGroundRangeExtension_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasHighGroundRangeExtension (spell flag)\">HasHighGroundRangeExtension</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IgnoreVisionBlock_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IgnoreVisionBlock (spell flag)\">IgnoreVisionBlock</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(spell_flag)\" title=\"Invisible (spell flag)\">Invisible</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsHarmful_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsHarmful (spell flag)\">IsHarmful</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsJump_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsJump (spell flag)\">IsJump</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/Stealth_(spell_flag)\" title=\"Stealth (spell flag)\">Stealth</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_(spell_flag)\" title=\"Temporary (spell flag)\">Temporary</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by spells:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bladesong\" title=\"Bladesong\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Bladesong_Icon.webp/25px-Bladesong_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Bladesong_Icon.webp/38px-Bladesong_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Bladesong_Icon.webp/50px-Bladesong_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bladesong\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Bladesong_Icon.webp/25px-Bladesong_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/80/Bladesong_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bladesong\" title=\"Bladesong\">Bladesong</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Bladesong Climax is a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jump\" title=\"Jump\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp/20px-Jump_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp/30px-Jump_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp/40px-Jump_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jump\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp/20px-Jump_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jump\" title=\"Jump\">Jump</a> action with a base range of 9 m (30 ft) instead of 4.5 m (15 ft). Everything that increases the range of normal jumps, particularly <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Enhance_Leap\" title=\"Enhance Leap\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/46/Enhance_Leap_Icon.webp/20px-Enhance_Leap_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/46/Enhance_Leap_Icon.webp/30px-Enhance_Leap_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/46/Enhance_Leap_Icon.webp/40px-Enhance_Leap_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Enhance Leap\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/46/Enhance_Leap_Icon.webp/20px-Enhance_Leap_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/46/Enhance_Leap_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Enhance_Leap\" title=\"Enhance Leap\">Enhance Leap</a>, will also increase the range of Bladesong Climax.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715040103\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.100 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.104 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4719/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 87644/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 34962/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 24/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.039/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1420462/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n103.13%   86.663     65 Template:Trim\n100.00%   84.029      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   84.029      1 -total\n 27.96%   23.495     14 Template:Icon_text\n 23.40%   19.661     11 Template:Icon_link\n 17.02%   14.301      3 Template:SmCond\n 16.94%   14.231      3 Template:SmSAI\n 13.84%   11.626      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n  8.90%    7.479      2 Template:Hidden_code\n  7.71%    6.480     14 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:48954-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715040103 and revision id 335622. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}